  "body": "[tfreedman] okay, so I have a really weird bug to report\r\nfrom what I can figure out, I was somehow added to this room at like, 3 AM last night (EST)\r\nthen I quit it, and was somehow re-added within the last hour\r\nand then I couldn't quit the room, because I got an M_UNKNOWN room when I tried to quit it\r\nso I switched to the built in client on my homeserver, and joined the room just now\r\nand have been watching all the messages in this room despite my client showing that I wasn't in it\r\n\r\nuser is `@tyler:tylerfreedman.com`",
